To ensure uninterrupted access for the new reporting initiative, I recommend renewing DataAnalytics Server with an expansion to 70 concurrent sessions and renewing DesignSuite Pro at its current level of 120 seats. This approach provides the necessary buffer for the incoming analytics contractors while avoiding wasteful spend on DesignSuite, where we already hold 8 unassigned seats. 

@primary_vendor_account_manager, please provide the formal quote for this configuration, including the discounted per-session pricing for the DataAnalytics Server expansion. 

@it_operations_manager, this moderate expansion easily fits within our current budget and my authorized limits, so I will execute the renewal once the pricing is verified to secure your team's access, unless you have any objections.

@primary_vendor_account_manager, please proceed with issuing the ready-to-approve renewal order for Option 2, comprising 120 seats of DesignSuite Pro and 70 concurrent sessions of DataAnalytics Server. 

@finance_licensing_analyst, for our formal records, this modest expansion of DataAnalytics Server is justified by recent peak usage data hitting 58 sessions and the onboarding of new contractors for the reporting initiative. 

@it_operations_manager, this configuration gives your team the necessary buffer to avoid disruptions during the upcoming ramp-up. I will execute the final approval as soon as the vendor provides the formal paperwork.
